  "description": "One render budget for every tile of the wall, from budgetctl.py at 55e81ad5 (the oracle here): every 2 s, once every placed tile has reported, the smallest budget_fit smoothed half the way each round; the first budget the ladder rung under fit / 1.15; down to the rung under the fit when the budget exceeds the smoothed fit by 5%, and a rung at once when a tile's render_ms_max is over 90% of a slot; up to the rung under fit / 1.15 after three rounds in a row allow it; one start time t for every tile, a second past the newest frame drawn. Covers mixed-speed tiles on both sides, noise within the margin, a tile joining mid-adjustment, an overloaded frame, and the slowest tile leaving.",
